      <!-- ===================== 5. COMPACTION ===================== -->
      <h2 class="section">
        <span class="num">5</span
        ><span data-lang="pt"><em>Compaction</em> — quando a janela enche</span
        ><span data-lang="en">Compaction — when the window fills up</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="kicker">
        <span data-lang="pt"
          >Sessões longas esgotam a janela de contexto. A <em>compaction</em>
          <em>resume</em> mensagens antigas e mantém as recentes. É com perdas —
          mas o histórico completo <strong>nunca é apagado</strong>; ele segue
          vivo no JSONL.</span
        ><span data-lang="en"
          >Long sessions exhaust the context window. Compaction
          <em>summarizes</em> older messages and keeps recent ones. It's lossy —
          but the full history is <strong>never deleted</strong>; it lives on in
          the JSONL.</span
        >
      </p>

