          <p>
            <span data-lang="pt"
              ><strong>Controle manual:</strong>
              <code class="inline">/compact</code> agora, ou
              <code class="inline">/compact foque no refactor de auth</code>
              para guiar o resumo. O automático dispara no overflow (recupera +
              retenta) ou perto do limite (proativo).</span
            ><span data-lang="en"
              ><strong>Manual control:</strong>
              <code class="inline">/compact</code> now, or
              <code class="inline">/compact focus on the auth refactor</code> to
              steer the summary. Auto fires on overflow (recovers + retries) or
              near the limit (proactive).</span
            >
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="callout warn" style="margin: 0">
          <p>
            <span data-lang="pt"
              ><strong>Ela nunca corta num resultado de ferramenta</strong> —
              resultados ficam colados à sua chamada de ferramenta. Um turno
              gigante acima do orçamento? O Pi faz um “turno dividido” com dois
              resumos mesclados.</span
            ><span data-lang="en"
              ><strong>It never cuts at a tool result</strong> — results stay
              glued to their tool call. One giant turn over budget? Pi makes a
              "split turn" with two merged summaries.</span
            >
          </p>
        </div>
