        >
        · <span data-lang="pt">ajuste via</span
        ><span data-lang="en">tune via</span>
        <code class="inline"
          >compaction.{enabled, reserveTokens, keepRecentTokens}</code
        >.
      </p>

      <!-- ===================== 6. BRANCH SUMMARIES + SETTINGS ===================== -->
      <h2 class="section">
        <span class="num">6</span
        ><span data-lang="pt">Resumos de ramo &amp; os botões</span
        ><span data-lang="en">Branch summaries &amp; the knobs</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="kicker">
        <span data-lang="pt"
          >Quando você <code class="inline">/tree</code> <em>para longe</em> de
          um ramo, o Pi oferece resumir o caminho que você está deixando e
          injetá-lo no novo ponto — então o contexto sobrevive ao salto. Mesmo
          motor da <em>compaction</em>; rastreia arquivos cumulativamente.</span
        ><span data-lang="en"
          >When you <code class="inline">/tree</code> <em>away</em> from a
          branch, Pi offers to summarize the path you're leaving and inject it
          at the new spot — so context survives the jump. Same engine as
          compaction; tracks files cumulatively.</span
        >
      </p>

      <pre
        class="block"
      ><span class="c"><span data-lang="pt">// ~/.pi/agent/settings.json  (ou .pi/settings.json)</span><span data-lang="en">// ~/.pi/agent/settings.json  (or .pi/settings.json)</span></span>
{
  <span class="s">"compaction"</span>: {
    <span class="s">"enabled"</span>: true,            <span class="c"><span data-lang="pt">// compaction automática on/off</span><span data-lang="en">// auto-compaction on/off</span></span>
    <span class="s">"reserveTokens"</span>: 16384,     <span class="c"><span data-lang="pt">// espaço deixado para a resposta</span><span data-lang="en">// room left for the reply</span></span>
    <span class="s">"keepRecentTokens"</span>: 20000   <span class="c"><span data-lang="pt">// quanto do contexto recente sobrevive</span><span data-lang="en">// how much recent context survives</span></span>
  },
  <span class="s">"treeFilterMode"</span>: <span class="s">"labeled-only"</span>  <span class="c"><span data-lang="pt">// seu filtro /tree padrão</span><span data-lang="en">// your default /tree filter</span></span>
}</pre>
      <div class="callout key">
        <p>
          <span data-lang="pt"
            ><strong>Jogada de poder:</strong> defina
            <code class="inline">treeFilterMode: "labeled-only"</code> e rotule
            seus pontos de virada (<span class="kbd">Shift</span>+<span
              class="kbd"
              >L</span
            >). Sessões longas viram um punhado de marcadores pelos quais você
            voa — sem rolar por spam de ferramenta.</span
          ><span data-lang="en"
            ><strong>Power move:</strong> set
            <code class="inline">treeFilterMode: "labeled-only"</code> and label
            your turning points (<span class="kbd">Shift</span>+<span
              class="kbd"
              >L</span
            >). Long sessions become a handful of bookmarks you can fly between
            — no scrolling through tool spam.</span
          >
        </p>
      </div>

